<title>USA: Petro Geo-Services sets $360 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Petro Geo-Services sets $360 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following $360 million debt issue from Petroleum Geo-Services A/S was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Donaldson Lufkin and Jenrette Securities.</p>
<p>The deal was upped in size from an initial $300 million to meet investor demand, dealers said.</p>
<p>BORROWER PETROLEUM GEO-SERVICES ASA</p>
<p>AMT $360 MLN	   COUPON 7.50	 MATURITY 03/31/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR UNSEC NOTES ISS PRICE 99.324  FIRST PAY DATE LAST MOODY'S BAA3    YIELD  7.597	PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS   SPREAD +88 BP     CALLABLE MAKE-WHOLE</p>
<p>						   AT TREASURIES +20 BP</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
